Package: quickmap
Title: Quick Air Quality Maps with Leaflet
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: person("Iarla", "Kilbane-Dawe", email = "iarlakd@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates interactive and static air quality maps showing pollution
    data (NO2, PM2.5) overlaid with school locations and borough boundaries.
    Uses Leaflet for interactive HTML maps and supports static JPG export.
    Designed for UK local government air quality reporting, but can plot 
    any coloured points on a map. 
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
